NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000985 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000986 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000987 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000988 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000989 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000990 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000991 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000992 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000993 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000994 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000995 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000996 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000997 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000998 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000999 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001000 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001001 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001002 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
